      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# 实时总览中心\n集中查看车辆在线状态、电量、续航、位置、里程和固件，并快速进入地图、当前驾驶、当前充电及状态时间线。\n\n[数据总览](/d/be2m9kga7b8qoc/teslamate-home?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [实时总览](/d/tmOverviewHubCN/overview-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [行程与足迹](/d/tmDrivingHubCN/driving-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [充电与费用](/d/tmChargingHubCN/charging-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [电池与能效](/d/tmEnergyHubCN/energy-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [分析与洞察](/d/tmAnalysisHubCN/analysis-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to) · [系统与数据](/d/tmSystemHubCN/system-center?var-car_id=$car_id&from=$__from&to=$__to)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.1+security-01",
      "type": "text"
    },
